# Deep links to JS-rendered routes serve the SPA shell (200 keeps the URL).
# Destination is "/" not "/index.html": Workers static assets rejects rewrites
# to *.html / */index as loops, and "/" resolves to index.html anyway.
# Any other unknown path falls through to 404.html (not_found_handling in
# wrangler.jsonc) with a real 404 status.
/corsi/*   /   200
/privacy   /   200
/cookie    /   200
